  "translate_en|mods/PhunSprinters2/common/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox_EN.txt|Sandbox_PhunSprinters_SlowInLight_tooltip": "If sprinter is running, light over your darkness level (eg a flashlight) can force them to walk (until its too dark again). Note that this is basically included in the tile based mode above",
